                              "path": "home/projects/SecureCurtain/sys/kernel/include/linux/linux-6.10.10/include/linux/kbd_diacr.h",
                              "language": "c",
                              "description": "Source file kbd_diacr.h",
                              "content": "/* SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0 */\n#ifndef _DIACR_H\n#define _DIACR_H\n#include <linux/kd.h>\n\nextern struct kbdiacruc accent_table[];\nextern unsigned int accent_table_size;\n\n#endif /* _DIACR_H */\n"
