              "description": "Source file fw_widget.h",
              "content": "#pragma once\n#include <stdint.h>\n\n#define FW_WDGT_X    740\n#define FW_WDGT_Y    380 // Positioned cleanly below the Sandbox Memory Monitor Widget\n#define FW_WDGT_W    240\n#define FW_WDGT_H    340\n\nvoid render_firewall_monitor_map_widget(void);"
